---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteForms } from '../config/site';
export function getStaticPaths() { return siteForms().review ? [{ params: { reviewPage: 'support' } }] : []; }
---
<Layout title="Support draft — Approaching Infinity" description="Local draft of business support terms for independent educational media." noindex={true}><section class="page-shell"><div class="wrap"><div class="page-heading"><h1>Support useful work.</h1><p>Draft for review. Payments are not open.</p></div><div class="prose"><h2>What support would fund</h2><p>Support for Approaching Infinity’s independent educational media could help fund production, free practical resources and free public learning sessions. We will describe the specific work and costs before asking for payment.</p><h2>Business support terms</h2><p>This would be support for an educational media business. It is not a charitable donation and is not represented as tax-deductible. Support would not purchase investment access, financial advice, editorial influence, a guest appearance or access to participant information.</p><h2>Sponsorship inquiries</h2><p>A sponsor could discuss underwriting a defined free resource or session, with clearly disclosed acknowledgment and written scope. No audience size, attendance, outcome or advertising result is promised. Editorial decisions remain independent.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Discuss a sponsorship</a></p><h2>Before payments open</h2><p>The operating entity, existing payment account, charge and payout readiness, receipt information and refund terms still require verification and owner approval. No checkout or payment link is active in this preview.</p></div></div></section></Layout>
